    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom of Evergold has spent centuries battling Shadowvale, a nation of dark creatures hell-bent on world domination. As the war raged on, news reached the King of Evergold of a magical artifact hidden in the Mystery Islands, a place populated only by criminals and sinners. An artifact so powerful that it would allow Evergold to finally rid the continent of all evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no matter how many holy knights and heroes the king sent, none of them ever returned. Until one of Evergold's finest minds, the court wizard, hatched a new, desperate plan: Send a band of misfits to blend in with the locals and steal the wondrous artifact! Nothing could possibly go wrong!... Could it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will these three outcasts, each with their own past and their own problems, succeed in their mission? Or will they fail miserably, like everyone else before them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Beautiful 4K hand drawn environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Intriguing story in a medieval fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 3 controllable characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Amusing\u00a0turn based combat with cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A variety of clever and balanced puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Original soundtrack.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom of Evergold has spent centuries battling Shadowvale, a nation of dark creatures hell-bent on world domination. As the war raged on, news reached the King of Evergold of a magical artifact hidden in the Mystery Islands, a place populated only by criminals and sinners. An artifact so powerful that it would allow Evergold to finally rid the continent of all evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no matter how many holy knights and heroes the king sent, none of them ever returned. Until one of Evergold's finest minds, the court wizard, hatched a new, desperate plan: Send a band of misfits to blend in with the locals and steal the wondrous artifact! Nothing could possibly go wrong!... Could it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will these three outcasts, each with their own past and their own problems, succeed in their mission? Or will they fail miserably, like everyone else before them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Beautiful 4K hand drawn environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Intriguing story in a medieval fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 3 controllable characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Amusing\u00a0turn based combat with cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A variety of clever and balanced puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Original soundtrack.</p>",
    "short_description": "When a group of outcasts is sent to retrieve a wondrous artifact, a fatal mistake brings chaos upon the world. Explore, solve puzzles and card battle your way through a unique medieval fantasy setting full of magic with 3 controllable characters and in stunning 4K hand-drawn visuals.",
